-- =====================================================================
-- Session 156 — Matt 27 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter,
-- drafted SOLO per S156 parallel-batch model)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 27's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S155 (Matt 23) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 27 lands as the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR crucifixion-narrative
-- chapter — Yahudah''s (Judas''s) remorse + the thirty-pieces-into-the-
-- temple-treasury + Pilate''s trial + Bar-Abba (Barabbas) substitution
-- + Pilate''s-wife''s-dream + *his blood be on us, and on our children*
-- + Roman-mocking-and-crowning + Shim''on (Simon) of Cyrene bearing
-- the cross + Gulgolta (Golgotha) + Tehillim (Psalm) 22:18''s casting-
-- of-lots + the mocking-at-the-cross + the FRAMEWORK substantial-
-- darkness-from-the-sixth-hour-to-the-ninth-hour + the FRAMEWORK-MAJOR
-- *Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani* + the temple-veil-rent-from-the-top-to-
-- the-bottom + the earthquake + the graves-opened-and-the-saints-
-- arising (first-resurrection-foretaste) + the centurion''s-confession
-- + the women-from-Galilee + the burial in Yoseph (Joseph) of
-- Arimathea''s rich-man''s-tomb + the guard-at-the-sealed-tomb. Six
-- framework-bearing narrative-movements anchor the chapter:
--
--   (a) Yahudah (Judas) repenting himself + the thirty-pieces-of-silver
--       into the temple-treasury + the potter''s-field (vv.1-10) —
--       *I have sinned in that I have betrayed the innocent blood*; the
--       chief-priests'' *what is that to us? see thou to that*; the
--       Zekharyah (Zechariah) 11:12-13 + Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 19 + 32
--       combined Tanakh-prophetic-fulfillment-attribution-substance.
--       The Greek *metamelētheis* (remorse) substance distinguished
--       from *metanoia* (true-repentance) per 2 Corinthians 7:10''s
--       *the sorrow of the world worketh death.*
--   (b) the trial-before-Pilate + the Bar-Abba (Barabbas) substitution
--       + Pilate''s-wife''s-dream + *his blood be on us, and on our
--       children* (vv.11-26) — the King''s-silence-before-Pilate the
--       Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:7 *as a sheep before her shearers is
--       dumb* substance; the Bar-Abba (son-of-the-father) substitution
--       the Yom Kippur two-goats-substance pre-figures; Pilate''s-
--       wife''s-dream the Tanakh-pattern of-the-individual-nations-
--       figures-receiving-warning. The *his blood be on us, and on our
--       children* substance read CAREFULLY per Red Line #9 — the
--       framework does NOT promote Jew-hatred; the verse is the
--       Yerushalayim (Jerusalem)-crowd-at-the-Sanhedrin-leadership-
--       moment self-imprecation, NOT the transgenerational-curse-on-
--       the-Yahudim (Jews) the inherited-Christian-replacement-
--       theology has weaponized for centuries; the framework reads
--       the leadership-and-people distinction the framework holds
--       throughout the four-costumes-and-their-victims architecture.
--   (c) the Roman-mocking-and-crowning + scourging (vv.27-31) — the
--       scarlet-robe + crown-of-thorns + reed-as-scepter + *Hail, King
--       of the Yahudim (Jews)* + spitting-and-smiting — the mock-
--       coronation IS the mock-coronation of the King who IS the
--       King; the irony the gospel preserves; Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 50:6
--       *I gave my back to the smiters* + Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:3
--       *despised and rejected of men* + Mikhah (Micah) 5:1 *smite
--       the judge of Yashar''el (Israel) with a rod upon the cheek*
--       carrying the substance.
--   (d) FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — the substantial-crucifixion proper (vv.32-50)
--       — Shim''on (Simon) of Cyrene bearing-the-cross; Gulgolta
--       (Golgotha); the vinegar-mingled-with-gall (Tehillim (Psalm)
--       69:21); the casting-lots-for-the-garments (Tehillim (Psalm)
--       22:18); the superscription *THIS IS YAHUSHA (JESUS) THE KING
--       OF THE YAHUDIM (JEWS)*; the two-thieves-numbered-with-the-
--       transgressors (Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:12); the mockers'' *if
--       thou be the Son of Elohim (God), come down from the cross*
--       (echoing Matt 4:3, 6''s wilderness-Satan-temptation pattern);
--       the three-hours-of-darkness-from-the-sixth-hour-to-the-ninth-
--       hour (Amos 8:9''s *I will cause the sun to go down at noon*);
--       the *Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani* citing Tehillim (Psalm) 22:1
--       — read CAREFULLY per Red Line #10''s nature-of-God reading:
--       this is the King''s-prayer-of-the-Suffering-Servant praying
--       the Psalm-of-vindication-through-suffering (Tehillim 22 walks
--       AS A WHOLE from apparent-forsakenness in vv.1-21 INTO
--       vindication in vv.22-31''s *I will declare thy name unto my
--       brethren ... all the ends of the world shall remember and
--       turn unto Yahuah (the LORD)*); NOT the Trinity-co-equal-
--       person-being-forsaken-by-the-Father reading the inherited-
--       Christian-collapse walks; the framework reads the Formed-Son
--       in the submission-to-the-Formless-Father praying the Psalm
--       that ends in vindication.
--   (e) FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — the death + the signs (vv.50-54) — the
--       loud-voice-and-yielding-up-the-ghost (John 10:17-18''s *no man
--       taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself*); the
--       temple-veil-rent-from-the-top-to-the-bottom (Yahuah-the-Father
--       tearing-it-from-the-heavenly-side opening-the-way-back-into-
--       the-Father''s-house per Hebrews 10:19-22, NOT the antichrist-
--       replacement-theology-the-temple-system-replaced-by-the-church
--       reading); the earthquake-and-rocks-rent; the graves-opened +
--       many-bodies-of-the-saints-arose (first-resurrection-foretaste
--       per Red Line #11 — the forefathers-who-walked-the-covenant-
--       faithfully Yahuah is able to graft-in-again per Romans 11:24);
--       the Roman-centurion''s *truly this was the Son of Elohim (God)*
--       — the individual-nations-figure-recognizing-the-King per
--       Red Line #7''s individual-mercy-cases (NOT the categorical-
--       Gentile-inclusion-substance the inherited-Christian-collapse
--       walks).
--   (f) the burial in Yoseph (Joseph) of Arimathea''s rich-man''s-tomb
--       + the women-witnesses + the guard-at-the-sealed-tomb (vv.55-66)
--       — Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:9''s *he made his grave with the
--       wicked, and with the rich in his death* walks out completely-
--       substantively; the women-faithful-witness when the male-
--       disciples have fled (Matt 26:56''s *all the disciples forsook
--       him, and fled*); the Father''s-irony — the Roman-imperial-
--       watch-set-by-the-leadership becomes-substantively the Roman-
--       imperial-witness-of-the-resurrection per Matt 28:11-15.
--
-- The cross-references the canon already carries (Tehillim (Psalm) 22
-- + Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53 + Zekharyah (Zechariah) 11:12-13 + Tehillim
-- 69:21 + Amos 8:9 + Yo''el (Joel) 2:31 + Hebrews 10:19-22 + Daniel
-- 12:2 + 1 Corinthians 15:20-23 + John 10:17-18 + Galatians 3:13
-- + Devarim (Deuteronomy) 21:22-23 + Acts 4:25-28) carry the Tanakh-
-- and-apostolic-fulfillment-substance at the canon-level. The extras-
-- library adds five framework-bearing thread-clusters anchored at the
-- chapter''s load-bearing-new architectures:
--
--   Thread 1 (sort 357 — FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): the substantial-temple-veil-
--     rent-and-the-way-back-into-the-most-holy-place-opened — 2 Baruch
--     6:7 (Charles seq #3) on the angel-descending-into-the-Holy-of-
--     Holies + Testaments of the XII Patriarchs / Levi (the heavens-
--     opened-and-the-holy-temple-seen substance) — the wisdom-stream''s
--     direct external-witness articulation of the door-home-opening at
--     the heavenly-register, the Father-from-above tearing-the-veil-
--     from-the-heavenly-side architecture per Hebrews 10:19-22 in
--     continuity with the framework''s reading of the cross as the
--     door-home opening per the *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and
--     the Mercy of Depart* exposition in framework-deep.md.
--   Thread 2 (sort 358): the substantial-faithful-righteous-suffering-
--     unto-death-and-the-atoning-blood-architecture-in-4-maccabees —
--     the seven-sons-and-the-mother substance + Eleazar''s lived-
--     confession + 4 Maccabees 17:18''s *as it were become a ransom
--     for our nation''s sin; and through the blood of these righteous
--     men and the propitiation of their death, the divine Providence
--     delivered Yashar''el (Israel)* — the wisdom-stream''s direct
--     external-witness to the categorically-exempt-One-paying-the-
--     atonement-substance the categorically-bound-owed architecture
--     the cross walks-out at full-scale per Hebrews 7:27''s *this he
--     did once, when he offered up himself.* Read CAREFULLY against
--     the framework''s reading per *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and
--     the Mercy of Depart* — NOT the inherited-Reformation-forensic-
--     substitutionary-juridical-transaction collapse; the cross opens
--     the door-home and the consequence-system stays operative.
--   Thread 3 (sort 359): the substantial-kings-and-the-mighty-
--     condemning-the-Elect-One-and-the-Elect-One-vindicated-on-the-
--     throne-of-his-glory-in-1-enoch-parables — 1 Enoch 62-63''s
--     direct articulation of the kings-and-the-mighty-and-the-exalted
--     summoned-before-the-Son-of-Adam-on-the-throne-of-his-glory
--     architecture — the present-tense-mocking-at-the-cross (Matt
--     27:39-43) the wisdom-stream eschatologically-reverses at the
--     day-of-vindication when *all the kings and the mighty and the
--     exalted and those who rule the earth shall fall down on their
--     faces before him and worship and set their hope upon that Son
--     of Adam* (1 Enoch 63:3). Threaded continuity with S155 Matt 22''s
--     `the-elect-one-at-the-right-hand-the-davidic-lord-witnessed-in-
--     1-enoch-parables` (different application — that thread anchors
--     the right-hand-enthronement; this thread anchors the suffering-
--     that-precedes-the-vindication architecture).
--   Thread 4 (sort 360): the substantial-day-of-the-most-high-cosmic-
--     darkness-and-the-resurrection-of-the-righteous-in-2-esdras-and-
--     2-baruch — 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:28-33 + 2 Baruch 51''s direct
--     articulation of the my-Son-the-Messiah-shall-die + the world-
--     turned-into-the-old-silence-seven-days + the earth-shall-restore-
--     those-asleep-in-her architecture — the wisdom-stream pre-figures
--     directly the cosmic-darkness at noon (vv.45-49) + the graves-
--     opened and the bodies-of-the-saints-arose (vv.52-53) per Red
--     Line #11''s first-resurrection-foretaste reading.
--   Thread 5 (sort 361 — FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): the substantial-Beloved-
--     crucified-on-a-tree-descended-and-risen-and-many-of-the-
--     righteous-ascending-with-Him-in-Ascension-of-Isaiah-9-and-11 —
--     Ascension of Isaiah 9:14-17 + 11:19-21''s direct external-witness
--     articulation of the god-of-this-world-stretching-forth-his-hand-
--     against-the-Son + the crucify-Him-on-a-tree + the descended-to-
--     the-angel-of-Sheol + the rise-again-after-the-third-day + the
--     many-of-the-righteous-ascending-with-Him architecture. AI 9:17''s
--     *many of the righteous will ascend with Him, whose spirits do
--     not receive their garments till Yahuah (Lord) Messiah (Christ)
--     ascend and they ascend with Him* is THE direct external-witness
--     verbal-anchor for Matt 27:52-53''s graves-opened-and-the-bodies-
--     of-the-saints-arose-and-came-out-of-the-graves-after-his-
--     resurrection substance. Per Yoshi''s S32 sourcing-decision (api/
--     seed.py:EDITION_PROFILES["ascension-isaiah"]), AI is the *first
--     witness* aligning with the framework''s Formless-Father /
--     Formed-of-the-Formless nature-of-God teaching — pre-Nicene,
--     late-1st / early-2nd CE, before the Constantine-era Trinity-
--     construct hardened.
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- 21 cross_references rows total + 5 new threads + 21 thread members.
--
-- Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar''el, Ya''aqov,
-- Yechezk''el, Yo''el, Sha''ul, Yo''seph, King''s, Father''s, Pilate''s,
-- wife''s, etc.) and English possessives (wisdom-stream''s, master''s,
-- King''s, framework''s, etc.) are escaped per SQL single-quoted-string-
-- literal convention (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- NOTE on solo-drafting: Per the S156 parallel-batch model, Matt 27 is
-- drafted SOLO with cold-context-with-full-skill rather than late-
-- context-with-cumulative-fatigue. The Matt 28 chapter is being drafted
-- by a sibling subagent in parallel — this migration has no awareness
-- of Matt 28''s thread decisions, and that is intentional. Yoshi
-- reviews-and-cross-checks-across-the-batch on the apply pass.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 156 — Matt 27 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S154 view.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s156_xref_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 21 extras-tier cross_references rows.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- =====================================================================
  -- Thread 1 (sort 357): the-temple-veil-rent-and-the-way-back-into-the-most-holy-place-opened-in-2-baruch-and-testaments-xii
  -- =====================================================================

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 51, 'pseudepigrapha', '2-baruch', 3, 7,
   '*And I saw him descend into the Holy of Holies, and take from thence the veil, and the holy ark, and the mercy-seat, and the two tables, and the holy raiment of the priests, and the altar of incense, and the forty-eight precious stones, wherewith the priest was adorned and all the holy vessels of the tabernacle.* 2 Baruch (Charles edition seq #3, verse 7; standard 2 Baruch 6:7) names the wisdom-stream''s direct external-witness articulation of the heavenly-angel-descending-into-the-Holy-of-Holies-and-taking-the-veil substance — the wisdom-stream had named the veil-architecture at the heavenly-register (the angel-from-above acting upon the veil), and Matt 27:51''s *the veil of the temple was rent in twain from the top to the bottom* names the operative-fulfillment at the earthly-pivot. The framework reads the verses together: the *from the top to the bottom* direction names the Father-from-above tearing-the-veil-from-the-heavenly-side, opening-the-way-back-into-the-Most-Holy-Place per Hebrews 10:19-22''s *boldness to enter into the holiest by the blood of Yahusha (Jesus), by a new and living way, which he hath consecrated for us, through the veil, that is to say, his flesh.* This is the door-home opening architecturally per the *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* exposition in framework-deep.md — grace as the means of return-to-the-Father''s-house, NOT the inherited-Christian-replacement-theology reading that the temple-system-is-now-replaced-by-the-church (the framework rejects the abolition-of-the-Father''s-house reading; the framework reads the veil-rent as Yahuah-opening-the-Way-back-into-the-Father''s-house, not as Yahuah-abolishing-the-Father''s-house). FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 51, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 14, 5,
   '*And thereupon the angel opened to me the gates of heaven, and I saw the holy temple, and upon a throne of glory the Most High.* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs / Testament of Levi (Charles edition seq #14, verse 5; standard Test. Levi 3:5—4:2 conjoint at the verse-break) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the gates-of-heaven-opened-and-the-holy-temple-seen substance the temple-veil-rent at Matt 27:51 enacts at the historical-pivot. The framework reads the verses together: the angel-opening-the-gates-of-heaven at the Test. Levi vision is the wisdom-stream''s heavenly-register articulation of the architecture the Father walks-out at the cross — when the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel)''s flesh-veil is torn, the gates-of-heaven that the Test. Levi vision opened in vision-form are opened operative-form. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the architecture: the gates-of-heaven-opened, the holy-temple-revealed, the way-to-the-Father-opened — the framework reads the substance per Red Line #11''s ingathering-of-the-paternal-blood-remnant architecture and Red Line #4''s Torah-stands-fulfilled-not-abolished posture.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 51, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 15, 2,
   '*Upon a throne of glory the Most High. And He said to me: Levi, I have given thee the blessings of the priesthood until I come and sojourn in the midst of Yashar''el (Israel).* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs / Testament of Levi (Charles edition seq #15, verse 2; standard Test. Levi 4:2 at the verse-break) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the *until I come and sojourn in the midst of Yashar''el (Israel)* substance — the priesthood-blessing-architecture is provisional-until the Most-High-Himself-comes-and-sojourns. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:51''s veil-rent: when the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-the-cross at the historical-pivot, the *I come and sojourn* substance the Test. Levi vision had named is operative-walked; the veil-rent names the architectural-consequence — the provisional-priestly-mediation-architecture is fulfilled-completed in the One whose body is the New-and-Living-Way per Hebrews 10:20. The framework reads this in continuity with John 1:14''s *the Word was made flesh, and dwelt (skēnoō — tabernacled) among us* — the *sojourn-in-the-midst* substance the Test. Levi vision had named at the wisdom-stream-register the King walks-out at the incarnation-and-cross substance. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the temple-fulfillment architecture.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 52, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 15, 17,
   '*And some of them shall be high priests, and judges, and scribes ; For by their mouth shall the holy place be guarded.* Testaments of the XII Patriarchs / Testament of Levi (Charles edition seq #15, verse 17; standard Test. Levi 4:17 at the chapter-conclusion) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the *holy place guarded* substance in continuity with the *I come and sojourn* substance of seq #15 v.2. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:52''s *the graves were opened; and many bodies of the saints which slept arose* — the saints-arising-at-the-cross substance is the architectural-rehearsal-in-foretaste of the broader first-resurrection-of-the-faithful per Red Line #11; the *holy place guarded by their mouth* substance the Test. Levi vision named at the wisdom-stream-register the saints-arising substance carries at the historical-pivot. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture in the prefiguring-passage; the cross opens the door-home for the architecture to walk-out operative.'),

  -- =====================================================================
  -- Thread 2 (sort 358): the-faithful-righteous-suffering-unto-death-and-the-atoning-blood-architecture-in-4-maccabees
  -- =====================================================================

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 42, 'pseudepigrapha', '4-maccabees', 11, 3,
   '*Her seven sons according to the tyrant''s promise, loved rather religion, which saveth unto eternal life according to Elohim (God).* 4 Maccabees (Charles edition seq #11, verse 3; standard 4 Macc 15:3) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the choosing-the-eternal-life-over-the-present-life-preservation substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:42''s mockers'' *he saved others; himself he cannot save. If he be the King of Yashar''el (Israel), let him now come down from the cross, and we will believe him* — the mockers'' framing-of-the-choice is exactly the choice the seven-sons-and-the-mother had walked-out at the wisdom-stream-register: the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) chooses-the-eternal-life-architecture (the cross + the resurrection + the gathering-of-the-twelve-tribes-coming-home) over the present-life-preservation (the come-down-from-the-cross) the mockers cannot see. The King COULD save-himself-substantively per Matt 26:53 + John 10:17-18 (*no man taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself*); he chooses the Pesach (Passover)-lamb-substance per the Father''s-purpose-substance. The wisdom-stream had named the priority-architecture at the martyrdom-witness; the King at the cross walks-out the same priority at the universal-substance-of-the-fulfillment.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 43, 'pseudepigrapha', '4-maccabees', 6, 18,
   '*But as many as with their whole heart make righteousness their first thought, these alone are able to master the weakness of the flesh, believing that unto Elohim (God) they die not, as our patriarchs, Abraham and Isaac and Jacob, died not, but that they live unto Elohim (God).* 4 Maccabees (Charles edition seq #6, verse 18; standard 4 Macc 7:18-19) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the unto-Elohim-they-die-not substance — the patriarchs Avraham (Abraham), Yitschaq (Isaac), Ya''aqov (Jacob) live-unto-Elohim, sleeping-awaiting-the-first-resurrection (Red Line #11''s reading of Romans 11:24''s natural-branches-able-to-be-grafted-in-again). The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:43''s mockers'' *he trusted in Elohim (God); let him deliver him now, if he will have him: for he said, I am the Son of Elohim (God).* The mockers'' challenge is the inverse of the architecture the wisdom-stream named: the live-unto-Elohim substance does NOT require the present-deliverance-from-the-cross-substance the mockers demand; the deliverance-architecture is the resurrection-after-the-third-day per Hosheia (Hosea) 6:2 + the patriarchs-sleeping-awaiting-the-first-resurrection per Hebrews 11:39-40 (*they without us should not be made perfect*). The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the cross walks-out the King''s-own-walking-into-the-patriarchs''-pattern.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 50, 'pseudepigrapha', '4-maccabees', 13, 13,
   '*For on that day virtue, proving them through endurance, set before them the prize of victory in incorruption in everlasting life.* 4 Maccabees (Charles edition seq #13, verse 13; standard 4 Macc 17:13) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the endurance-unto-the-prize-of-incorruption-in-everlasting-life substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:50''s *Yahusha (Jesus), when he had cried again with a loud voice, yielded up the ghost* — the King''s-voluntary-laying-down-of-the-life is the supreme-walking-out of the endurance-architecture the wisdom-stream named at the seven-sons-and-the-mother martyrdom-witness. The Greek *aphēken to pneuma* — *yielded up the spirit* — names the voluntary-substance per John 10:17-18 (*no man taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself*); the prize-of-victory-in-incorruption is the resurrection-on-the-third-day + the first-resurrection-at-the-King''s-coming per Red Line #11. The wisdom-stream had named the prize-architecture; the King walks-into-the-prize at the substance of his own laying-down-of-his-life.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 50, 'pseudepigrapha', '4-maccabees', 13, 18,
   '*The tyrant himself and his whole council admired their endurance, whereby they now do both stand beside the throne of Elohim (God) and live the blessed age. ... they having as it were become a ransom for our nation''s sin; and through the blood of these righteous men and the propitiation of their death, the divine Providence delivered Yashar''el (Israel) that before was evil entreated.* 4 Maccabees (Charles edition seq #13, verse 18; standard 4 Macc 17:18-22) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the *ransom for our nation''s sin* + *the blood of these righteous men* + *the propitiation of their death* + *the divine Providence delivered Yashar''el (Israel)* substance — the wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the categorically-exempt-righteous-paying-the-atonement-substance-the-categorically-bound-owed at the seven-sons-and-the-mother martyrdom-witness centuries before the cross. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:50''s *yielded up the ghost* as the operative-walking-out at universal-scale of the architecture the wisdom-stream named at the small-Maccabean-scale: the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-the-blood-of-the-righteous + the propitiation-of-his-death + the Father''s-providence-delivering-the-twelve-tribes-substantively at the substance of Hebrews 7:27''s *this he did once, when he offered up himself.* Read CAREFULLY against the framework''s reading per the *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* section of framework-deep.md — the cross is the door-home opening architecturally (grace as the means of return-to-the-Way), NOT the inherited-Reformation-forensic-substitutionary-juridical-transaction collapse that the cross cancels-the-curse-system; the framework reads the categorically-exempt-One-paying-the-atonement-substance-the-categorically-bound-owed in continuity with the Matt-17:24-27 temple-tax pre-figuring (S154''s thread already names this architecture in miniature; Matt 27:50 walks-it-out at full-scale). FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  -- =====================================================================
  -- Thread 3 (sort 359): the-kings-and-the-mighty-condemning-the-elect-one-and-the-elect-one-vindicated-on-the-throne-of-his-glory-in-1-enoch-parables
  -- =====================================================================

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 1, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 63, 1,
   '*In those days shall the kings and the mighty and the exalted and those who possess the earth Be summoned, And they shall be made to stand before the Elect One on that day of judgement.* 1 Enoch 63:1 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the kings-and-the-mighty-and-the-exalted-summoned-before-the-Elect-One architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:1''s *when the morning was come, all the chief priests and elders of the people took counsel against Yahusha (Jesus) to put him to death* — the morning-council the substantial-Sanhedrin-leadership walks-out at the historical-pivot is the architectural-inverse of the day-of-vindication-summons the wisdom-stream had named. The kings-and-the-mighty-and-the-exalted-of-the-historical-pivot (the corrupted-Sanhedrin-leadership + the Roman-prefect Pontius-Pilate + Hordos (Herod)-Antipas) take-counsel-against-the-Anointed at the substance per Tehillim (Psalm) 2:2 + Acts 4:25-28; the kings-and-the-mighty-and-the-exalted-of-the-day-of-vindication shall-be-summoned-before-the-Elect-One per the eschatological-reversal. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the cross walks-out the present-tense-suffering-substance that-precedes-the-vindication-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 42, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 62, 3,
   '*And He will summon all the host of the heavens, and all the holy ones above, And the host of Elohim (God), the Cherubim, Seraphim and Ophanim, And all the angels of power, and all the angels of principalities, And the Elect One, and the other powers on the earth, and over the water, On that day.* 1 Enoch 62:3 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the Elect-One-summoned-with-the-host-of-the-heavens substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:42''s mockers'' *if he be the King of Yashar''el (Israel), let him now come down from the cross, and we will believe him* — the mockers cannot-see the architecture the wisdom-stream named: the Elect-One''s-credential is NOT the come-down-from-the-cross substance the mockers demand; the Elect-One''s-credential is the summoning-with-the-host-of-the-heavens at the day-of-vindication. The King COULD-have-summoned-twelve-legions-of-angels per Matt 26:53; he walks-the-cross-substantively per the Father''s-purpose-substance. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-Elect-One-summoning-the-heavenly-host; the cross is the present-tense-suspension-of-the-architecture for the substance of the Father''s-purpose-walking-out-the-Pesach-lamb-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 43, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 62, 7,
   '*And Yahuah (God) of Spirits said: ‘This is the Son of Adam who is born unto righteousness, And righteousness abides over him, And the righteousness of the Head of Days forsakes him not.’* 1 Enoch 62:7 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the *righteousness of the Head of Days forsakes him not* substance — the wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the Son-of-Adam''s-being-not-forsaken centuries before the cross. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:43''s mockers'' *he trusted in Elohim (God); let him deliver him now, if he will have him: for he said, I am the Son of Elohim (God)* AND against Matt 27:46''s *Eli, Eli, lama sabachthani — my Elohim (God), my Elohim (God), why hast thou forsaken me?* The mockers'' framing reads-the-cross as the apparent-forsakenness; the wisdom-stream had named the operative-truth: the righteousness-of-the-Head-of-Days forsakes-him-not. The King''s-prayer at v.46 is the Suffering-Servant-praying-Tehillim (Psalm) 22 — the Psalm that begins in apparent-forsakenness (Tehillim 22:1) but ends in vindication (Tehillim 22:22-31''s *I will declare thy name unto my brethren* + *all the ends of the world shall remember and turn unto Yahuah (the LORD)*). Per Red Line #10''s nature-of-God reading: this is NOT the Trinity-co-equal-person-being-forsaken-by-the-Father reading; the framework reads the Formed-Son in the submission-to-the-Formless-Father praying the Psalm-of-vindication-through-suffering. The wisdom-stream and the gospel cohere at the *righteousness-of-the-Head-of-Days-forsakes-him-not* architecture.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 42, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 63, 3,
   '*And all the kings and the mighty and the exalted and those who rule the earth Shall fall down on their faces before him and worship and set their hope upon that Son of Adam, And shall petition him and supplicate for mercy at his hands.* 1 Enoch 63:3 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the eschatological-reversal — the kings-and-the-mighty who-presently-mock at the cross shall-eventually fall-down-on-their-faces and worship the Son-of-Adam. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:42''s mockers'' *let him now come down from the cross, and we will believe him* AND against Philippians 2:10-11''s *that at the name of Yahusha (Jesus) every knee should bow, of things in heaven, and things in earth, and things under the earth; and that every tongue should confess that Yahusha (Jesus) HaMashiach (Christ) is Lord, to the glory of Elohim (God) the Father.* The wisdom-stream had named the reversal-architecture: the present-tense-mocking-at-the-cross is the architectural-inverse of the eschatological-confession-and-worship; the same-figures who-presently-mock will eventually-bow. The framework reads this carefully against Red Line #11''s post-harvest-sifting architecture — the eschatological-bowing is the universal-acknowledgment, not the universal-salvation; the kings-and-the-mighty who-do-not-extol-Yahuah''s-name-substantively face-the-shame-and-darkness per 1 Enoch 62:11-12 + 63:11. The wisdom-stream had named the reversal; the cross walks-out the present-tense-suffering-substance that precedes-the-vindication-substance.'),

  -- =====================================================================
  -- Thread 4 (sort 360): the-day-of-the-most-high-cosmic-darkness-and-the-resurrection-of-the-righteous-in-2-esdras-and-2-baruch
  -- =====================================================================

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 45, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 30,
   '*And the world shall be turned into the old silence seven days, like as in the former judgments: so that no man shall remain.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:30 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the world-turned-into-old-silence substance — the apocalyptic-stream had named the architecture of the cosmic-darkness-and-silence at the day-of-the-Messiah''s-death + the post-death-silence-before-the-resurrection. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:45''s *now from the sixth hour there was darkness over all the land unto the ninth hour* — the three-hours-of-darkness at the substance of the King''s-walking-into-the-cross is the historical-pivot-foretaste of the broader-cosmic-darkness the apocalyptic-stream had named. 2 Esdras 7:28-29 names the architecture directly — *my son the Messiah shall be revealed... after these years shall my son Messiah (Christ) die, and all men that have life. And the world shall be turned into the old silence seven days.* The wisdom-stream had named the Messianic-death-and-cosmic-darkness architecture; the cross walks-out the historical-pivot-fulfillment per Amos 8:9''s *I will cause the sun to go down at noon, and I will darken the earth in the clear day.* FRAMEWORK-MAJOR for the wisdom-stream''s direct prefiguring.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 51, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 33,
   '*And the Most High shall appear upon the seat of judgment, and misery shall pass away, and the long suffering shall have an end.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:33 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Most-High-appearing-upon-the-seat-of-judgment substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:51''s veil-rent + the earthquake + the rocks-rent — the cosmic-signs at the cross are the historical-pivot-foretaste of the broader-day-of-the-Most-High the apocalyptic-stream had named. The framework reads this in continuity with Haggai 2:6-7''s *I will shake the heavens, and the earth* + Hebrews 12:26-27''s *yet once more I shake not the earth only, but also heaven.* The wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the Most-High-appearing-and-misery-passing-away; the cross walks-out the in-flesh-substance of the day-of-the-Most-High''s-acting at the historical-pivot. The eschatological-day-of-the-Most-High the apocalyptic-stream named at the wisdom-register is rehearsed-in-foretaste at the historical-cross-pivot.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 52, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 7, 32,
   '*And the earth shall restore those that are asleep in her, and so shall the dust those that dwell in silence, and the secret places shall deliver those souls that were committed to them.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 7:32 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the earth-restoring-those-asleep-in-her substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:52''s *and the graves were opened; and many bodies of the saints which slept arose* — the saints-arising-at-the-cross substance is the historical-pivot-foretaste of the broader first-resurrection per Red Line #11. 2 Esdras 7:32 names the architecture directly: the earth-restoring-those-asleep-in-her + the dust-restoring-those-who-dwell-in-silence + the secret-places-delivering-the-committed-souls. The framework reads the verses together in continuity with Daniel 12:2''s *many of them that sleep in the dust of the earth shall awake* + Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 37:1-14''s valley-of-dry-bones + 1 Corinthians 15:20-23''s *Messiah (Christ) the firstfruits; afterward they that are Messiah''s (Christ''s) at his coming.* Per Red Line #11''s first-resurrection-foretaste reading: the forefathers-who-walked-the-covenant-faithfully Yahuah is able to graft-in-again at the first-resurrection (Romans 11:24 + Hebrews 11:39-40); the Matt 27:52-53 saints-arising substance is the historical-foretaste-of-the-fuller-first-resurrection-at-the-King''s-coming.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 52, 'pseudepigrapha', '2-baruch', 21, 1,
   '*But those who have been saved by their works, And to whom the law has been now a hope, And understanding an expectation, And wisdom a confidence, Shall wonders appear in their time. For they shall behold the world which is now invisible to them, And they shall behold the time which is now hidden from them.* 2 Baruch (Charles edition seq #21, verse 1; standard 2 Baruch 51:1-8) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the saved-by-their-works-shall-behold-the-world-now-invisible substance — the apocalyptic-stream''s resurrection-glory architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:52-53''s *and the graves were opened; and many bodies of the saints which slept arose, and came out of the graves after his resurrection, and went into the holy city, and appeared unto many* — the saints-arising-and-appearing-in-the-holy-city substance is the historical-pivot-foretaste of the broader-architecture 2 Baruch 51 names: the faithful-righteous-shall-behold-the-world-now-invisible + shall-be-made-like-unto-the-angels + shall-be-equal-to-the-stars. The framework reads the saved-by-their-works language CAREFULLY — NOT the inherited-Reformation-merit-doctrine collapse; the framework reads works as the fruit-of-the-Spirit-internalized-Torah per Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) 36:26-27 + Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) 31:31-34 + James 2:14-26''s *faith without works is dead*; the works are the Spirit-empowered-walking-in-the-Way the framework''s *Grace, the Way, the New Heart, and the Mercy of Depart* exposition unfolds. The wisdom-stream had named the architecture-of-the-resurrection-glory; the saints-arising-at-the-cross substance is the historical-foretaste.'),

  -- =====================================================================
  -- Thread 5 (sort 361): the-beloved-crucified-on-a-tree-descended-and-risen-and-many-of-the-righteous-ascending-with-him-in-ascension-of-isaiah
  -- =====================================================================

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 35, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 9, 14,
   '*And the god of that world will stretch forth his hand against the Son, and they will crucify Him on a tree, and will slay Him not knowing who He is.* Ascension of Isaiah 9:14 names THE direct external-witness verbal-anchor for the god-of-that-world-stretching-forth-his-hand-against-the-Son-and-they-will-crucify-Him-on-a-tree substance — the wisdom-stream had named the architecture of the world-rulers-and-their-rulers-not-knowing-who-the-Son-is at the heavenly-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:35''s *and they crucified him* — the operative-walking-out at the historical-pivot of the architecture Ascension of Isaiah had named centuries before at the wisdom-stream-witness. The framework reads the *not knowing who He is* substance in continuity with 1 Corinthians 2:8''s *had they known it, they would not have crucified the Lord of glory.* The framework reads the *crucify Him on a tree* substance in continuity with Devarim (Deuteronomy) 21:22-23 + Galatians 3:13''s *cursed is every one that hangeth on a tree* — the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-the-curse-of-the-Deuteronomy-28-exile-judgment-substance the twelve-tribes-walked-substantively, as the Pesach (Passover)-lamb-substance, walking-out-the-substance the twelve-tribes-can-be-gathered-home-substantively per Red Line #4''s reading (the curse is the exile-judgment, NOT the Torah; the King walks-the-curse, not the abolishing-of-the-Torah). Per Yoshi''s S32 sourcing-decision (api/seed.py:EDITION_PROFILES["ascension-isaiah"]), AI is the *first witness* aligning with the framework''s Formless-Father / Formed-of-the-Formless nature-of-God teaching — pre-Nicene, late-1st / early-2nd CE. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 50, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 9, 16,
   '*And when He hath plundered the angel of death, He will ascend on the third day, and he will remain in that world five hundred and forty-five days.* Ascension of Isaiah 9:16 names the wisdom-stream''s direct external-witness articulation of the plundered-angel-of-death-and-ascend-on-the-third-day substance — the architecture of the King''s descent-into-death-and-resurrection-on-the-third-day at the wisdom-stream-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:50''s *Yahusha (Jesus), when he had cried again with a loud voice, yielded up the ghost* — the King''s-voluntary-walking-into-death is the substance Ascension of Isaiah names as the descent-to-plunder-the-angel-of-death. The framework reads the verses in continuity with Hosheia (Hosea) 6:2''s *after two days will he revive us: in the third day he will raise us up* + Hosheia (Hosea) 13:14''s *I will ransom them from the power of the grave* + 1 Peter 3:18-20''s *put to death in the flesh, but quickened by the Spirit: by which also he went and preached unto the spirits in prison* + Hebrews 2:14-15''s *that through death he might destroy him that had the power of death, that is, the devil; and deliver them who through fear of death were all their lifetime subject to bondage.* The wisdom-stream and the apostolic-stream cohere at the descent-to-plunder-the-angel-of-death architecture per Red Line #11''s reading.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 52, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 9, 17,
   '*And then many of the righteous will ascend with Him, whose spirits do not receive their garments till Yahuah (Lord) Messiah (Christ) ascend and they ascend with Him.* Ascension of Isaiah 9:17 names THE direct external-witness verbal-anchor for the *many of the righteous will ascend with Him* substance — the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the architecture Matt 27:52-53 walks-out at the historical-pivot. The framework reads the verses together: AI 9:17 IS the operative external-witness verbal-anchor for *the graves were opened; and many bodies of the saints which slept arose, and came out of the graves after his resurrection, and went into the holy city, and appeared unto many* (Matt 27:52-53). The substance the gospel walks-out at the historical-cross-pivot is the substance Ascension of Isaiah had named at the wisdom-stream-register. The *whose spirits do not receive their garments till Yahuah (Lord) Messiah (Christ) ascend and they ascend with Him* substance reads in continuity with Hebrews 11:39-40''s *these all, having obtained a good report through faith, received not the promise: Yahuah (God) having provided some better thing for us, that they without us should not be made perfect* per Red Line #11. The forefathers-who-walked-the-covenant-faithfully Yahuah is able to graft-in-again at the first-resurrection (Romans 11:24); Matt 27:52-53 is the historical-foretaste of the broader-first-resurrection-at-the-King''s-coming. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 35, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 20,
   '*In Jerusalem indeed I saw Him being crucified on a tree.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:20 names the wisdom-stream''s direct external-witness historical-attestation of the crucified-on-a-tree-in-Jerusalem substance — the prophet-Yeshayahu (Isaiah)-saw-in-vision what the King walked at the historical-pivot. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:35''s *and they crucified him* — the wisdom-stream had named the operative-substance at the prophet-Yeshayahu-register; the historical-pivot at the cross is the seeing-what-Yeshayahu-saw substance walking-out. The framework reads this in continuity with John 12:41''s *these things said Esaias (Isaiah), when he saw his glory, and spake of him* — the prophet Yeshayahu (Isaiah) saw the King at multiple registers (the holy-holy-holy-vision of Yeshayahu 6, the Suffering-Servant of Yeshayahu 53, the Ascension-of-Isaiah-11-vision of the King''s-Bethlehem-birth-and-cross). The cross walks-out the substance the prophet saw-in-vision centuries before.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 27, 60, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 19,
   '*And after this the adversary envied Him and roused the children of Yashar''el (Israel) against Him, not knowing who He was, and they delivered Him to the king, and crucified Him, and He descended to the angel of Sheol.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:19 names the wisdom-stream''s direct external-witness articulation of the descended-to-the-angel-of-Sheol substance — the King''s-burial-and-descent-into-the-place-of-the-dead architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 27:60''s *and laid it in his own new tomb, which he had hewn out in the rock: and he rolled a great stone to the door of the sepulchre, and departed* — the burial in Yoseph (Joseph) of Arimathea''s rich-man''s-tomb walks-out the Yeshayahu (Isaiah) 53:9''s *he made his grave with the wicked, and with the rich in his death* substance AND is the historical-pivot of the descent-to-the-angel-of-Sheol architecture AI 11:19 names. The framework reads the substance carefully against Red Line #9 — the *roused the children of Yashar''el (Israel) against Him* substance reads in continuity with the framework''s system-not-people posture per the four-costumes-and-their-victims architecture: the adversary-roused-the-leadership-of-the-second-Temple-aristocracy at the historical-pivot, NOT the substantial-Yahudah (Jewish)-people-as-a-whole; the framework rejects the inherited-Christian-replacement-theology weaponization of this verse against the Yahudim (Jews) as a people. The cross + the descent + the resurrection-on-the-third-day are the architecture the wisdom-stream named at the prophet-Yeshayahu-vision-register.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug   = i.src_edition
                           AND sv.book_slug      = i.src_slug
                           AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                           AND sv.verse_number   = i.src_v
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug   = i.tgt_edition
                           AND tv.book_slug      = i.tgt_slug
                           AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                           AND tv.verse_number   = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

